hakios-thyme

Two licenses apply, by directory — the same split the base HakiOS project uses:

1. The kernel-side material in **src/kernel/** (the port's overlay of drivers and XNU modifications,
   including bsd/conf/files) is a derivative work of Apple's XNU and is therefore licensed under
   the **Apple Public Source License, Version 2.0** — the full text is in LICENSE.APSL. Per its
   terms these modifications are published here as source, with the notices that belong to the
   modified files kept in them.

2. Everything else that is ours — the documentation, the scripts, the build tools, src/sideload.c,
   src/loader/ (the base project's MIT-licensed loader and this port's patch), src/userland/ and
   src/kernel-patches/ — is licensed under the **MIT License** below.

The UEFI map in **src/uefi/Library/MemoryMapLib/** and the UmiXnu.c handoff in
**src/uefi/Library/BootManagerLib/** are adapted from
azzlantern/hackios-thyme and retains that package's **APSL 2.0** license.
See src/uefi/README.md for the exact source revision and LICENSE.APSL for its text.

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in NOTICE.md. Apple's operating system and its
firmware images (IPSW), Apple's trademarks, and the phone's own firmware are **not** part of this
repository and are not licensed by it; every user obtains them from their own device and their own
copy of the software.

